  * scripts/ + tests/ -- 52 root-variable sites, type-preserving (str stays str),
    each verified to resolve to the identical directory.
  * sys.path poisoning: 3 test files + 3 bootstrap scripts. A hardcoded absolute
    path on sys.path poisons a whole xdist worker, so even correctly
    repo-relative scripts then write into the operator's checkout.

